# BACKUP / RECOVERY

Production backup is mandatory.

Required:
- approved RPO/RTO;
- protected backups;
- appropriate encryption;
- restricted access;
- monitoring;
- failure alerts;
- retention;
- restore tests;
- recovery runbooks.

Do not invent RPO/RTO values.

A successful backup is not enough. Restore testing is required to establish recoverability.
